{"title": "Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff", "pageid": 44950, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Polymorph.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Polymorph.webp/300px-Polymorph.webp, /w/images/1/14/Polymorph.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Polymorph.webp/300px-Polymorph.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Polymorph.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> used by <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a> when he gets summoned at <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_Apple_a_Day\" title=\"An Apple a Day\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Summon_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Summon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Summon_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Summon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Summon_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Summon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"An Apple a Day\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Summon_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Summon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Generic_Summon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></sp