.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Wildshape_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wildshape (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">Wildshape</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff\"> Condition: Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Shadow Mastiff in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Shadow_mastiff\"> Creature: Shadow mastiff </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png/120px-Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png.webp, /w/images/6/61/Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png/120px-Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Portrait_Shadow_mastiff.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>14</span></b></div> <span>(+2)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>13</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>33</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>14</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowjaw_Bite\" title=\"Shadowjaw Bite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/40px-Bite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/60px-Bite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/80px-Bite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowjaw Bite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/40px-Bite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowjaw_Bite\" title=\"Shadowjaw Bite\">Shadowjaw Bite</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Sink your teeth into a target and possibly knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></span>. </dd>\n</dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knockdown_Jaws\" title=\"Knockdown Jaws\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knockdown Jaws\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Knockdown_Jaws\" title=\"Knockdown Jaws\">Knockdown Jaws</a></span></dt><dd>Bite attacks from this creature can possibly knock the target <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowblend\" title=\"Shadowblend\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Generic_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Generic_Invisibility_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Generic_Invisibility_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Invisibili